      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Basically you want the near clipping plane to be configured by the user, not the world creator.\nCurrently the near clipping plane is controlled by the world and thus the creator of that world.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-the-camera-near-clip-plane-to-be-configured-by-the-player",
      "viewerReactions": null
